lass=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns an iterator. Equivalent to:\n<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*outer_iterator*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*simple_view*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns an <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/lazy_split_view/outer_iterator\"><code><i>outer_iterator</i></code></a> or a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\">std::default_sentinel</a></span>.\n<p>Equivalent to:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/forward_range\"><span class=\"kw2922\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">forward_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/forward_range\"><span class=\"kw2922\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">forward_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>\n              <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/common_range\"><span class=\"kw2926\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">common_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*outer_iterator*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">else</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\"><span class=\"kw2897\">std::<span class=\"me2\">default_sentinel</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>An <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/lazy_split_view/outer_iterator\"><code><i>outer_iterator</i></code></a> or a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\">std::default_sentinel</a></span> representing the end of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/view\"><code>view</code></a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1256\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string_view</span></span></a> keywords<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"false float for friend\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/lazy_split_view\"><span class=\"kw3699\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">lazy_split_view</span></span></a> kw<span class=\"br0\">{</span>keywords, <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> count <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</s